<title>USA: Prime Hospitality Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Prime Hospitality Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31		  1997    1996  CHANGE</p>
<p> Total revenues				   76,080  58,614  30%</p>
<p> Recurring income				  8,675   5,733  51%</p>
<p> Non-recurring items, net of taxes	     ---   2,059</p>
<p> Income before extraordinary items	   8,675   7,792  11%</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				  22     149</p>
<p> Net income					  8,697   7,941  10%</p>
<p> Fully diluted EPS: Recurring income	   .20     .17</p>
<p>  Non-recurring items				---     .05</p>
<p> Earnings per share				  .20     .22</p>
<p>  EBITDA					    25,877  19,365  34%</p>
<p>Hotel EBITDA(A)</p>
<p>  AmeriSuites					8,678   4,589</p>
<p>  Full-Service				    12,052   8,853</p>
<p>  Limited-Service				  6,824   5,406</p>
<p>   Total					    27,554  18,848</p>
<p>Hotel Data(B):</p>
<p>AmeriSuites</p>
