<p>  REVPAR					     55.74   53.19   5%</p>
<p>Total</p>
<p>  Occupancy					  67.8%   66.2%</p>
<p>  ADR						  77.48   71.04</p>
<p>  REVPAR					     52.51   47.03  12%</p>
<p>($ in thousands, except per share and hotel data amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE(A): Hotel EBITDA represents EBITDA generated from the operations of owned hotels and excludes those revenues and expenses which do not directly relate to the operations of owned hotels.</p>
<p>(B): Hotel data is presented for comparable hotels open for the full period in both 1997 and 1996.</p>
